OL,3,AThree killed after LA news helicopter
OL,4,Acrashes while covering deadly bus
OL,5,Acollision
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree people have died and two others
OL,8,Ftaken to hospital after a news
OL,9,Fhelicopter crashed in suburban Los
OL,10,FAngeles, fire authorities in the city
OL,11,Fhave said.
OL,13,FNBC Los Angeles confirmed the
OL,14,Fhelicopter was its NewsChopper4, which
OL,15,Falso operated for Telemundo 52, and was
OL,16,Fin the area on Tuesday reporting on a
OL,17,Fdeadly bus crash.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
